<title>INDONESIA: Danamon 1996 net up to 201.67 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Danamon 1996 net up to 201.67 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				201.67 vs  132.56</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 273    vs  296</p>
<p>    Net interest income		  794.42  vs 456.03</p>
<p>    Other operating income		87.77  vs  56.92</p>
<p>    Other operating expense	    615.18  vs 359.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 281.21  vs 193.42</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		    421.34  vs 275.68</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Bank Danamon Indonesia is one of the country's largest banks.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
